[114.355517, "o", "# Changelog\r\n## [2.3.2] - 2026-05-05\r\n\r\n\r\n## [2.3.1] - 2024-01-15\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed minor UI glitch\r\n\r\n## [2.3.0] - 2024-01-10\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- Added new dashboard widget\r\n\r\n## [2.2.0] - 2024-01-05\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- Initial release with core functionality\r\n"]
